83c_juy_DBABAC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文具名或局部代稱；身份依全傳及具體來源橋接，不按同字跨世代配人。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-yue"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue","book_id":"b-nanqishu-043","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu043-ws2400356"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-016-zhangji","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-016","source_id":"s-liangshu-016-zhangji-ws1508503","source":{"title":"張稷","provider":"Wikisource","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1508503","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1508503","revision_id":1508503,"edition":"維基文庫固定修訂","accessed_on":"2026-11-21","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫授權。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","extent":"張稷","text_scope":"complete_biography_unit","raw_path":"source-evidence/nanshi022-wangyun/external/liang016-ws1508503.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"40585b42092b90ee701fe144cb1093683a0916eaa4eb4e356eec7da7e7d773e6"}},{"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi","work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-034","source_id":"s-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi","source":{"title":"《南齊書》卷三十四〈庾杲之及附孔廣〉","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1514487","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1514487","revision_id":1514487,"accessed_on":"2026-10-19","extent":"庾杲之及附孔廣完整傳文單元，非全卷。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"edition":"維基文庫數位轉錄；未核底本影像","response_sha256":"2caa63316e7b1ba5314c93aae3eab684e6b6b442a2e4b674bd0a4e76a27d039c","wikitext_sha256":"c9c958070fff227bd14143a4ac7275ae1b53565c6f1eb27f29283b021955213e","rights":"古代正文；維基文庫數位轉錄保留來源及共享授權資訊。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"extraction_note":"只移除段首全形縮排及-{征}-等顯示語法，原字征及爲／卽不轉換；數位注獨立層。","excerpts":[{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line060","source_lines":[60,60],"raw_quote":"　　庾杲之字景行，新野人也。祖深之，雍州刺史。父粲，司空參軍。","raw_quote_sha256":"cc447479d559d48b7ba65f71601d441dd0b241b332cf4420e73b376bf5ac71e1","selected_text_sha256":"47545dd42bf24b533d5ab42a4f6838e162e7eb632e2afffd8240e5e35ac1119c","removed_digital_editorial_notes":[]},{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line062","source_lines":[62,62],"raw_quote":"　　杲之少而貞立，學涉文義。起家奉朝請，巴陵王-{征}-西參軍。郢州舉秀才，除晉熙王鎮西外兵參軍，世祖徵虜府功曹，尚書駕部郎。清貧自業，食唯有韭菹、𤅢韭、生韭雜菜，或戲之曰：「誰謂庾郎貧，食鮭常有二十七種。」言三九也。仍爲世祖撫軍中軍記室，遷員外散騎常侍，正員郎，遷中書郎，領荊、湘二州中正。","raw_quote_sha256":"b9bb58a27ccc9e3db473eb0aaf3659bfdfd585ccfa5e79b2eb96c6f6b43c0650","selected_text_sha256":"1b0f083f65878bb8f8f7060c200b09b7b10007fb2686870c2b53a9b6f5ff0450","removed_digital_editorial_notes":[]},{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line064","source_lines":[64,64],"raw_quote":"　　轉尚書左丞，常侍、領中正如故。出爲王儉衛軍長史，時人呼入儉府爲芙蓉池。儉謂人曰：「昔袁公作衛軍，欲用我爲長史，雖不獲就，要是意向如此。今亦應須如我輩人也。」乃用杲之。遷黃門郎，兼御史中丞，尋卽正。","raw_quote_sha256":"d4743a0b50ed6325e26b636b8b54d09ee04a1db2dd57e4f257ecac5746ca51a5","selected_text_sha256":"2f4cd73e9b826f0d5436f566e6d31e2db5a409bb674353a9a85b25328b2ee2d5","removed_digital_editorial_notes":[]},{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line066","source_lines":[66,66],"raw_quote":"　　杲之風範和潤，善音吐。世祖令對虜使，兼侍中。上每嘆其風器之美，王儉在座，曰：「杲之爲蟬冕所照，更生風采。陛下故當與其卽眞。」帝意未用也。永明中，諸王年少，不得妄與人接，敕杲之與濟陽江淹五日一詣諸王，使申游好。尋又遷廬陵王中軍長史，遷尚書吏部郎，參大選事。轉太子右衛率，加通直常侍。","raw_quote_sha256":"ed48ebf3aff20c9f8f4dd53caf918e6a08bd326858cb1b29a10b62942ebb992b","selected_text_sha256":"49d93669eb8ec5aa759d95dfa24836c095d4d5bf47057fe1b7dc4c679fa8ff0d","removed_digital_editorial_notes":[]},{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line068","source_lines":[68,68],"raw_quote":"　　九年，卒。臨終上表曰：「臣昨夜及旦，更增氣疾，自省綿痼，頃刻危殆，無容復臥。任居隆顯，玷塵明世，乞解所忝，待終私庭。臣以凡庸，謬徼昌運，獎擢之厚，千載難逢。且年逾知命，志事榮顯，脩夭有分，無所厝言。若天鑒微誠，暫借餘歷，傾宗殞元，陳力無遠。仰違庭闕，伏枕鯁戀。送貂蟬及章。」詔不許。杲之歷在上府，以文學見遇。上造崇虛館，使爲碑文。卒時年五十一，上甚惜之。諡曰貞子。","raw_quote_sha256":"20da8e6514e1168d54d2b55dad4d6452201258a634c794562c9104f6f06ea27d","selected_text_sha256":"1215f309822c7b76ffe100d58e9d9ac59771037df0e84852bab3558906918f45","removed_digital_editorial_notes":[]},{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line070","source_lines":[70,70],"raw_quote":"　　時會稽孔廣，字淹源，亦美姿制。歷州治中，卒。","raw_quote_sha256":"352f0a1acbc1191bd5bc2347dbbfe0dbc8fb986c41dfe289c659d7cbb78ce4d6","selected_text_sha256":"39a4e0d132053a8d4557b315d308f75712e86c6a28daabbe7aeb24643d7f6186","removed_digital_editorial_notes":[]}]}}},{"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue","work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-043","source_id":"s-nanqishu043-ws2400356","source":{"title":"《南齊書》卷四十三謝𤅢完整本傳（含兄顥附傳）","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=南齊書/卷43&oldid=2400356","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=南齊書/卷43&oldid=2400356","revision_id":2400356,"accessed_on":"2026-10-21","extent":"原行53至67共八完整段，謝𤅢本傳含顥附傳；止王思遠傳前，非全卷。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文及維基文庫數位轉錄；保留數位歸屬。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"維基文庫數位轉錄，未核底本影像","response_sha256":"3a6a97e651528165730c9449870379efdfddd44a36b17e7600fab6060b7b24ae","wikitext_sha256":"7a65e9b58b508ef0dbc64a4a650c99c30dcd94f8f13ea9a23d171f539174baed","normalization":{"character_conversion":{"{{!|𤅢|左「氵」右「𦿈」}}":"𤅢"},"extraction_note":"僅展開字形模板與YL日期連結，去兩全形縮排；不轉瀹、不改鞭除身或爲/爲等原字。"}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical","civil_year_label_field":"chinese_civil_year","civil_year_label_coverage":"partial","regnal_year_crosses_ce_year_is_gregorian_projection":true}}
